    "en": "A coastal motorway of approximately 103 km between the Black Sea cities of Varna and Burgas, on Pan-European Corridor VIII, estimated to cost €307 million. As of 2016 only the first 10 km, Varna to Priseltsi, had been built; the remaining 93 km is still at the planning stage."
